      "value": "Additional:\n\nWhen changing the profile banner through VRChat.com, the banner only updates on the Beta / Unity 6 Beta branch. The Stable branch does not load or use the newly updated JSON payload at all.\n\nThis means you can have two completely different profile banners depending on whether you are using the Beta or Stable branch.\n\nI honestly don't even have words for how broken this is.",
